    "intro_narrative": "The year is 2142. The world you once knew has been reduced to ash and twisted metal, ravaged by the Great Collapse. You are a Scavenger, wandering the irradiated wasteland of Sector 7. Your Geiger counter clicks rapidly as you stumble upon an underground bunker, its heavy blast doors slightly ajar. Inside lies a complex network of ancient terminals, cryptographic devices, and forgotten storage drives left behind by the architects of the old world. Your objective is clear: navigate this labyrinth of decayed technology, restore the power relays, and extract the encrypted emergency coordinates before the bunker's collapsing power grid seals you inside forever. Every device is interconnected, demanding logic and careful exploration to piece together the final transmission. Time is running out, and the wasteland forgives no mistakes.",
